Package: iod25
Title: English Indices of Deprivation (IoD25)
Version: 0.0.0.9005
Authors@R: 
    person("Douglas", "Munro", , "douglas@douglasmunro.co.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-6533-6423"))
Description: The Indices of Deprivation 2025 (IoD25) provide a set of
    relative measures of deprivation for small areas (Lower-layer Super
    Output Areas) across England, based on seven domains of deprivation.
    Contains public sector information licensed under the Open Government
    Licence v3.0.
